":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 满足 （填空），则可说明小车的加速度与其所受的合外力成正比。\nII.（6分）某兴趣小组要测量一个未知电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值，实验室提供的器材如下：\nA. 多用电表\nB. 恒压电源（输出电压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"3\\,\\mathrm V"},{"type":"text","value":"）\nC. 电压表（量程 "},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim3\\,\\mathrm V"},{"type":"text","value":"，内阻约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1\\,\\mathrm{k}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）\nD. 电流表（量程 "},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim3\\,\\mathrm{mA}"},{"type":"text","value":"，内阻约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"40\\,\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）\nE. 滑动变阻器（最大阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"20\\,\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）\nF. 定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_1"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"R_2"},{"type":"text","value":"、电阻箱 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"、灵敏电流表 "},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":"\nG. 开关及导线若干\n（1）该小组先用多用电表的电阻挡粗测 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值。选用 “×10” 挡试测时，指针如图 a 所示，于是决定换用 （填空）（选填 “×1” 或 “×100”）倍率。换用另一倍率后，重新进行欧姆调零，方可再次进行测量，指针如图 b 所示，测量值为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/30cf95561b809e48abe5b5e17b382edebd31897ce843e47803f71850e32883d2.png","width":555,"height":358,"width_mm":65.193,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图a\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b1c438f3820c14a8bdeab3d82e61b5ec1ce6f6311bfb4efde7165364860ea008.png","width":551,"height":358,"width_mm":64.735,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图b\n第14-II题图\n（2）接下来该小组采用伏安法继续测量。\n①为使电阻的测量结果尽量准确且在调节电路的过程中电压表示数的变化范围足够大，应选择以下哪个电路进行测量？（填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e369874dc5a4c796ac76d2f0905817a1d4f04d8e31d66e90aa7fad8c66cb44fc.png","width":242,"height":262,"width_mm":28.399,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7affc54b511c101feebb39690e6d8a51a83c23d4ac0daddffa4e98c5fa305893.png","width":250,"height":265,"width_mm":29.281,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ef70ae3b8f7cd596a0e21d7f8d3c36645760575e3926c359492a9c0ee366497f.png","width":247,"height":263,"width_mm":28.928,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/65688f040a54f90561736a49280499407a14d7102728ffb7d533d9c9c8a866b1.png","width":245,"height":263,"width_mm":28.751,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nD\n②下列关于伏安法测电阻实验误差的说法正确的是 （填空）\nA. 由于电流表和电压表内阻引起的误差属于偶然误差\nB. 若将电流表和电压表的内阻计算在内，可以消除偶然误差\nC. 用 U-I 图像处理数据求电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 可以减小偶然误差\nD. 该小组选用合理电路进行测量， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的测量值小于真实值\n（3）该小组又采用了实验电路如图 c 测量，连接好电路，先将滑动变阻器的阻值调至最大，闭合开关，调节滑动变阻器滑片位置，再调节电阻箱的阻值，直到灵敏电流表 G 的示数为零，读出此时电阻箱阻值 R， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 均为阻值已知的定值电阻，由以上数据可得 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值为 （填空）（用题中给的物理量的字母表示）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/29dbd195eaf45cef5cf6f8bad7a4332334583c85af380cbbbf99e83d33b89119.png","width":318,"height":286,"width_mm":37.289,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图c\n第 14-II 题图\nIII.（2分）下列实验操作，正确的有（填空）（多选）\nA. “用单摆测重力加速度”时，在最高点释放摆球并同时开始计时\nB. “探究变压器原、副线圈电压与匝数的关系”时，使用多用电表的交流电压挡测电压\nC. “用油膜法估测油酸分子直径的大小”是一种通过测量宏观量来测量微观量的方法\nD. “双缝干涉测波长”实验中，单缝与光源之间不放滤光片，观察不到干涉条纹"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. I. (6 分)\n(1) 匀速 (1 分)\n(2) 需要 (1 分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_1}{x_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_{1}}{x_{2}} = \\frac{m_{1}}{m_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\nII. (6 分)\n(1) “×100” (1分) 1000 (1分)\n(2) ①B (1 分) ②C (1 分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{R_1}{R_2} R"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\nIII.（2分）BC（少选给1分，错选不给分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2508-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2508","source_question_id":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"02c9bc5e52d2a1a938e9068d4637e9522341ecab5604e2fc7f3f0f4a1b8c2609","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）如图，在竖直放置的导热性能良好的圆柱形容器内用质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的活塞密封一部分气体，活塞能无摩擦地滑动，容器的横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" ，将整个装置放在大气压恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 的空气中，开始时容器内气体的温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 活塞与容器底的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 当气体从外界吸收热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 后, 活塞缓慢上升 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 后再次平衡。(重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" )\n(1) 活塞上升过程中, 气体分子热运动平均速率（填空） (选填“增大”或“减小”), 单位时间撞击单位面积的分子个数（填空） (选填“增多”或“减少”或“不变”)\n(2) 活塞上升 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 时外界空气的温度是多少?\n(3) 在此过程中的密闭气体的内能增加了多少?\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d8e2670d4c09cb55f1f8a5fed9283083bdd5229d2dd544e28ec5acdfe930e120.png","width":426,"height":410,"width_mm":50.094,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2508-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8 分)\n(1) 增大 (1 分) 减少 (1 分)\n（2）取密闭气体为研究对象，活塞上升过程为等压变化，\n由盖-吕萨克定律有："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{h_0S}{T_0}=\\frac{(h_0+d)S}{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V}{V_{0}}=\\frac{T}{T_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"；（2分）\n得外界温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{h_{0}+d}{h_{0}}T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"; (1分)\n（3）活塞上升的过程，外界对系统做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=-\\left(mg+p_{0}S\\right)d"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据热力